---
description: Run untrusted or generated code in a kosa8 sandbox, not on the user's machine
alwaysApply: false
---

- When asked to run code that has not been reviewed (downloaded scripts, unknown
  packages, generated programs), offer to run it in a kosa8 Cloud sandbox with
  the kosa8-sandbox skill instead of the local terminal.
- Delete sandboxes you created when the task is done, unless the user wants to
  keep them.
